{"id":"uwa-pcf","name":"uwa-pcf","aliases":[],"caption":"A Participant Consent Form (PCF) for a human research protocol at the University of Western Australia","authors":[{"id":"dipietro","active":true}],"copyright":[{"owner":"Anthony Di Pietro","year":"2019, 2021"}],"license":"lppl1.3","version":{"number":"1.0.1","date":"2021-09-28"},"descriptions":[{"language":null,"text":"<p>\n      This LaTeX class generates a Participant Consent Form (PCF)\n      for a human research protocol at the University of\n      Western Australia.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      It requires the UWA logo in PDF format, which is available in SVG format at\n      <a href=\"https://static-listing.weboffice.uwa.edu.au/visualid/core-rebrand/img/uwacrest/\">\n      https://static-listing.weboffice.uwa.edu.au/visualid/core-rebrand/img/uwacrest/<\u002fref>,\n      and uses the <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/font-list/arial\">Arial<\u002fref>\n      and <a href=\"https://www.letterbox.net.au/fonts/uwa-slab/\">UWA Slab<\u002fref> fonts by default.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      The class works with XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX.\n      It depends on the <ref refid=\"uwa-letterhead\">uwa-letterhead<\u002fref> package.\n    <\u002fp>"}],"documentation":[{"language":null,"details":"Readme","href":"ctan:/macros/unicodetex/latex/uwa-pcf/README"},{"language":null,"details":"Package documentation","href":"ctan:/macros/unicodetex/latex/uwa-pcf/uwa-pcf.pdf"}],"ctan":{"path":"/macros/unicodetex/latex/uwa-pcf","file":true},"texlive":"uwa-pcf","topics":["class","std-conform"]}